# These symbols must not disappear or change signature without bumping GIBSON_ABI_VERSION.
# This is a release guard for the Linux x86_64 ABI surface, not a cross-platform
# binary-compatibility proof. Verify/regenerate with scripts/release/check-abi.sh.
